{"id": 130139, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/ompxuzgy6vnqbfgk2pws.jpg"}], "slug": "occultic-nine", "summary": "Occultic;Nine is an Japanese visual novel that is based on a light novel of the same name. The game is descibed as a \"Paranormal Science Novel\". The story follows nine idiosyncratic individuals. Little incongruities that occur around these nine eventually lead to a larger, unimaginable event that may alter what is considered common sense in this world. Despite being by the same makers and sharing a similar naming scheme, Occultic;Nine is not a part of 5pb's Science Adventure series of adventure games.", "themes": [{"id": 17, "name": "Fantasy"}, {"id": 18, "name": "Science fiction"}, {"id": 20, "name": "Thriller"}, {"id": 43, "name": "Mystery"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/occultic-nine", "videos": [{"id": 16379, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "VxP3N3IiOMw", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=VxP3N3IiOMw", "title": "\u30b2\u30fc\u30e0\u300eOCCULTIC;NINE\u300f\u30aa\u30fc\u30d7\u30cb\u30f3\u30b0\u30e0\u30fc\u30d3\u30fc", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/VxP3N3IiOMw/maxresdefault.jpg"}], "collections": [{"id": 3539, "name": "Science Visual Novel"}]}